WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
A connected Mooring window shows the normal Omarchy desktop. The caption identifies installed build 50. No audio.

00:02.000 --> 00:16.000
The ordinary terminal opens with an anonymous prompt. The user runs uname to display the Linux kernel version.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
The user runs uptime. This is a real session at recorded speed.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
The terminal closes and the normal Omarchy desktop is visible again.
